---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Affiliate Disclosure — RigGamer"
  description="RigGamer Affiliate Disclosure. We earn commissions from game affiliate links. Read how this works."
>
<div class="legal-wrap">
  <div class="legal-inner">

    <div class="legal-hero">
      <div class="legal-kicker">// Legal</div>
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: <strong>September 20, 2026</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Applies to: <strong>riggamer.com</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-body">

      <h2>Our Relationship with Games</h2>
      <p>RigGamer participates in affiliate programs. This means that some links on our site — typically labelled "Play Free →", "Get [Game] Free →", or similar — are affiliate links. When you click one and complete a qualifying action, such as launching a game for the first time, we receive a small commission from the game's publisher or their affiliate network.</p>
      <p><strong>This never costs you anything extra.</strong> The games we promote are free to play, and no purchase is required to trigger a commission. The commission is paid by the publisher, not by you.</p>

      <h2>How Affiliate Links Are Identified</h2>
      <p>Affiliate links on RigGamer typically:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Lead to a <strong>/play/[game]</strong> URL on riggamer.com, which then redirects to the game</li>
        <li>Are styled as prominent call-to-action buttons ("Play [Game] Free →")</li>
        <li>May carry <code>rel="sponsored nofollow"</code> attributes in the HTML</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Regular text links and navigation links are not affiliate links unless they follow the pattern above.</p>

      <h2>Our Affiliate Partners</h2>
      <p>We currently work with the following affiliate networks and programs:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>AFBOOSTER</strong> — PC game Cost Per Play (CPP) affiliate program</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We may add or remove affiliate partners over time. This disclosure reflects our current arrangements.</p>

      <h2>Editorial Independence</h2>
      <p>Affiliate relationships do not influence our editorial content. Our reviews, guides, and opinions reflect our genuine assessment of each game based on hands-on testing. We will not write a positive review in exchange for compensation, and we are not paid per positive mention.</p>
      <p>When we identify genuine downsides to a game, we say so — even in articles that contain affiliate links to that game. Our readers' trust matters more than any commission.</p>

      <h2>FTC Compliance</h2>
      <p>In accordance with the U.S. Federal Trade Commission (FTC) guidelines on endorsements and testimonials, we disclose any material connection between RigGamer and the products or services we promote. This page, combined with in-article labels (e.g., "// SPONSORED" labels on CTA sections), constitutes our disclosure.</p>

      <h2>Questions?</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about our affiliate relationships or editorial policies, contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@riggamer.com">contact@riggamer.com</a>.</p>

    </div>

    <div class="legal-footer-nav">
      <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a>
      <a href="/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
</Base>

<style>
.legal-wrap { background: var(--bg); padding: 48px 0 80px; }
.legal-inner { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
.legal-hero { margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd); }
.legal-kicker { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--volt); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.legal-hero h1 { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.legal-meta { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 13px; color: var(--t4); }
.legal-body h2 { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; margin: 2em 0 .7em; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd); }
.legal-body p { color: var(--t2); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1em; }
.legal-body ul { color: var(--t2); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; margin: .5em 0 1em 1.4em; }
.legal-body ul li { margin-bottom: .4em; }
.legal-body code { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 13px; background: var(--surf2); padding: 2px 6px; color: var(--t2); }
.legal-body a { color: var(--volt); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(198,255,51,.3); transition: border-color .15s; }
.legal-body a:hover { border-color: var(--volt); }
.legal-footer-nav { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--brd); flex-wrap: wrap; }
.legal-footer-nav a { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 12px; color: var(--t3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; transition: color .15s; }
.legal-footer-nav a:hover { color: var(--volt); }
</style>
